{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tatsuya and Kaori Iwase are happily spending the day in their apartment when a new married couple moves into the apartment next door. The Kayabes seem like nice people, which puts the Iwases at ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, they soon come to realize just how thin their apartment walls are. Night after night, they are subjected to the panting, moaning, and seductive voices coming from the Kayabes\u2019 apartment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After tiring of putting up with the noise, the Iwases confront their neighbors and the nightly disturbances cease... only for them to almost immediately start up again, but now during the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An erotic visual novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E-mote animated character sprites</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488820/extras/df85034e42b32381085d72247ecd64fd.avif?t=1770719308\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kaori Iwase</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mint Amami</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lively and strong-willed, Mrs. Iwase works at a supermarket three days a week. She likes to believe that her gaining weight is all down to her growing older. Now that she\u2019s in her late thirties, she\u2019s been thinking about having children but hasn\u2019t been able to tell her husband.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488820/extras/55a6705b9518beb5cc3239a104c74117.avif?t=1770719308\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tatsuya Iwase</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bit indecisive and easily swayed, Mr. Iwase works for peanuts at a mid-sized company in their sales department. Mild-mannered and affable, he prefers to avoid conflict. But when push comes to shove, will he grow a backbone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488820/extras/afdc85d1563a85fbd83e8cba9ff411d8.avif?t=1770719308\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yuuna Kayabe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Karen Hanadera</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mrs. Kayabe has a calm and gentle way about her that runs counter to her voracious sexual appetite. She\u2019s the breadwinner for her family and works nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488820/extras/9ef56df631a8e7b62192e34ca64a7da6.avif?t=1770719308\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manzou Kayabe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the outside, Mr. Kayabe seems like a stout, good-natured, and humble man. In reality, he\u2019s a shitty husband who doesn\u2019t seem to have a job and is just as horny\u2014if not more so\u2014as his wife with a big dick to match.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3488820?t=1770719308","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488820/81358a9dacb0c2dbfe291cad49ecb4a98315c54b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770719308","capsule